    "tree_id": "1b6545e1715982a36846371da6d522367fcb0805",
    "message": "[ipa-delivery:727] build(delivery): private IPA 727, second request after run 43149001356 = the delivered 726 with RPCS3 Core 934, MeloNX Core 737, XeniaCore ABI 3 and the S2Arm Switch 2 engine\n\nFrozen on 7d90218f (effective digest 28dc0833, 7902 product files). The first\nrequest 2088c712 (run 43149001356) failed in three places, fixed in d68da380:\n- Dolphin retained608 input check: verify_ipa.py, declared in changedInputs,\n  is now accepted byte-exact.\n- StikJIT scoped host test: normalizes the exact engine closed-set block.\n- ARMSX2 library contract: expects the switch2 entry added by 6d492d75.\nNo other change. Components, pins and images are as in the first request:\n- RPCS3 Core 934, pin 8dc2ad44.\n- MeloNX Core 737, pin 954f28c6.\n- XeniaCore, pin 7e13268b.\n- S2Arm, pin 02feeda2.\nBase: the delivered and verified 726. Nothing of this build has been run on an\niPhone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-12T03:55:00Z",
